<title>ZIMBABWE: CRICKET-ZIMBABWE PRESIDENT'S XI V ENGLAND SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ZIMBABWE PRESIDENT'S XI V ENGLAND SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1996-12-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard in the one-day cricket</p>
<p>match between a Zimbabwe President's XI and England at the</p>
<p>Harare Sports Club on Sunday:</p>
<p>England</p>
<p> N.Knight c G.Flower b Brandes		    7</p>
<p> A.Stewart c A.Flower b Rennie		  105</p>
<p> M.Atherton c Strang b Brandes		    0</p>
<p> G.Thorpe b Brandes				   1</p>
<p> N.Hussain c G.Flower b G.Whittall	     50</p>
<p> R.Irani not out				     14</p>
<p> J.Russell not out				    8</p>
<p> Extras (lb-9 w-12 nb-5)			   26</p>
<p> Total (five wickets, 50 overs)		 211</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-15 2-15 3-24 4-157 5-194</p>
<p>Did not bat: R.Croft, A.Caddick, P.Tufnell, A.Mullally</p>
<p>Bowling: Brandes 10-0-42-3 (1w), J.Rennie 10-1-40-1 (2nb</p>
<p>4w),</p>
<p>G.Whittall 10-1-50-1 (4w), Strang 10-0-31-0 (3nb), A.Whittall</p>
<p>3-0-12-0, G.Flower 4-0-13-0, Evans 3-0-14-0 (3w)</p>
