<p> Extras (lb-2 w-16)				  18</p>
<p> Total (for five wickets, 45.5 overs)	 215</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-24 2-50 3-126 4-132 5-194</p>
<p>Did not bat: J.Rennie, E.Brandes, B.Strang, A.Whittall</p>
<p>Bowling: Mullally 10-4-18-0 (2w), Caddick 7.5-0-53-1, Irani</p>
